version: 2.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/jameshztta-stack/gc-ei-annotation-reliability"
url: "https://gc-ei-annotation.streamlit.app/"
abstract: "Streamlit software for tentative connectivity-level GC–EI–MS library annotation, with a frozen 8,455-identity research v2 HGB configuration and separately retained legacy v1. Source-dependent uncertainty estimates and uncertified historical error targets must not be interpreted as authenticated chemical identification."
keywords:
  - GC-MS
  - electron ionization
  - library annotation
  - confidence estimation
  - uncertainty quantification
  - reproducibility
  - cheminformatics
